; Each body's figure = its proposed share x the route C total. Mid figures match page 5475's illustration; low and high are the same share applied to its low and high totals.
; Roots are renamed so this memo can never be mixed with cash: Claimed = costs claimed by the family; Prospective = the balancing memo entry.
